== Description ==
The Dual Blade Toilet is a strong toilet that has two blades that it can use to stun your units. It only appears in Nightmare Mode. It can quickly kill the base if it reaches there. It has a stronger version called the Giant Dual Blade Toilet, which has more health and stuns faster.
